# kin/child/face/paint_dots: the child's face paint: three dots on each cheek (the accent; the people's own paint)
# (KIN-CHILD, P2b wave 2; the child, STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role paint dots
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
z 3
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -2 -8
|o.o..o.o
|.o....o.

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -8 -8
|o.o
|.o.

view L key rest origin -1 -8
|o.o
|.o.

